        "cooked": "<p>Hey all, I am a new SotM enthusiast. I want to work my way through all the variant challenges in the video game, but the guides I’m finding list them in alphabetical or card-type order. I’d really love an order that puts them in chronological order, either for the story, or for ease of unlocking order.<br>\nHas anyone come up with one of these? Or have any suggestions?!<br>\nThanks!</p>",
